    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game idea:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANGRY GOLF 2 is an amazing and fun arcade, a combination of angry birds and golf game. You will use the pointer to adjust power and direction then try to shoot the ball with maximum accuracy possible.<br>Your mission is shoot ball to reach the goal. But each level will be more complex and challenging !!<br>Every level has limit of shots that player can use to unlock next level. But if player uses too many shots will need to try it again to finish level and continue to the next.<br>Falling out of track will destroy your ball and will be respawned at the start.<br>Most levels contain different traps like bombs, evil pigs. Touching to those traps will destroy your ball and will be respawned last shooting place.<br>Player will get steam achievements when level finished without reaching the limits of shoots. You can also try to shoot hole in one!!<br>Game contains 18 levels<br>The ball can be only shooted when is totally stopped then after a shoot you will need to wait that ball be stopped for shoot again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 18 levels<br>- Achievements<br>- AMAZING POWER METER for more Accuracy<br>- BASIC SETTINGS IN-GAME<br>- LEVEL PROGRESSION. You can unlock and replay levels<br>- Traps like bombs and pigs<br>- Falling out of track and hitting traps will destroy your ball</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game idea:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ANGRY GOLF 2 is an amazing and fun arcade, a combination of angry birds and golf game. You will use the pointer to adjust power and direction then try to shoot the ball with maximum accuracy possible.<br>Your mission is shoot ball to reach the goal. But each level will be more complex and challenging !!<br>Every level has limit of shots that player can use to unlock next level. But if player uses too many shots will need to try it again to finish level and continue to the next.<br>Falling out of track will destroy your ball and will be respawned at the start.<br>Most levels contain different traps like bombs, evil pigs. Touching to those traps will destroy your ball and will be respawned last shooting place.<br>Player will get steam achievements when level finished without reaching the limits of shoots. You can also try to shoot hole in one!!<br>Game contains 18 levels<br>The ball can be only shooted when is totally stopped then after a shoot you will need to wait that ball be stopped for shoot again.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 18 levels<br>- Achievements<br>- AMAZING POWER METER for more Accuracy<br>- BASIC SETTINGS IN-GAME<br>- LEVEL PROGRESSION. You can unlock and replay levels<br>- Traps like bombs and pigs<br>- Falling out of track and hitting traps will destroy your ball</p>",
    "short_description": "sequel to angry golf. Try to shoot angry ball to goal, less quantity of shoots possible to beat all the levels. Avoid traps and falling from map in this strategic golf game",
